The law texts in this repository are official texts of the region of Piedmont (Regione Piemonte, Italy), taken from
Arianna (Consiglio regionale del Piemonte), https://arianna.cr.piemonte.it/.

Italian copyright law does not protect them. Legge 22 aprile 1941, n. 633 (protezione del diritto d'autore), art. 5: "Le disposizioni di questa legge non si applicano ai testi degli atti ufficiali dello Stato e delle amministrazioni pubbliche, sia italiane che straniere." (This law does not apply to the texts of the official acts of the State and of public administrations, Italian or foreign.)

The dataset is published by Regione Piemonte under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 licence, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Arianna's own pages carry a CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IT notice for the site's content; the law texts themselves are official acts outside copyright (art. 5 above).

The source is credited as it asks: Source: Consiglio regionale del Piemonte, Arianna - Banca Dati Normativa, https://arianna.cr.piemonte.it/ (open dataset "Arianna - Leggi regionali storiche e vigenti, regolamenti regionali", Regione Piemonte, CC BY 4.0) (consulted 2026-10-30).

This repository is not an official publication. The binding text is the one published in the Bollettino Ufficiale della Regione Piemonte.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
